verdict Color: There is no Color type; sides are chess.js 'w'/'b' and the gameboard's Player union.
  status: diverged
  evidence: [github:dxos/dxos/packages/ui/react-ui-gameboard/src/components/Gameboard/types.ts#Player]
  note: `react-ui-gameboard` declares `type Player = 'black' | 'white'`; plugin-game's `Game.Player.role` is a free string.
```

